<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>معرض أعمال سيف | مطور ألعاب</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: white; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
        header { width: 100%; padding: 50px 0; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%); border-bottom: 2px solid #38bdf8; }
        h1 { margin: 0; color: #38bdf8; font-size: 2.5rem; }
        .container { max-width: 800px; width: 90%; margin-top: 40px; display: grid; gap: 20px; }
        .card { background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; transition: 0.3s; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: #38bdf8; }
        .card h3 { margin: 0; color: #f8fafc; }
        .card p { margin: 5px 0 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .btn { background: #38bdf8; color: #0f172a; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; }
        footer { margin-top: 50px; padding: 20px; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>سيف مصطفى</h1>
        <p>مطور ألعاب HTML5 ومبرمج صاعد</p>
    </header>

